! ======================================================================================
! FW43B(AR) rear wing - FIRST TEST in Mechanical APDL: self weight only (no CFD loads needed).
! Same model as run_wing_apdl.inp, without the aerodynamic load step.
! Files needed in the same folder: materials_laminate_apdl.inp, rw_shell_medium_apdl.inp
! Expected: total vertical reaction FZ = about 61.5 N (mass about 6.27 kg), FX and FY about 0.
! ======================================================================================
/TITLE,FW43B(AR) rear wing - flap 0 deg - self weight test
/PREP7
/INPUT,materials_laminate_apdl,inp
/INPUT,rw_shell_medium_apdl,inp
CMSEL,S,N_SUPPORT
D,ALL,UX,0
D,ALL,UY,0
D,ALL,UZ,0
ALLSEL,ALL
FINISH
!
/SOLU
ANTYPE,STATIC
OUTRES,ALL,ALL
ACEL,0,0,9.81            ! gravity along -z
SOLVE
FINISH
!
/POST1
SET,1
CMSEL,S,N_SUPPORT
/COM, === SELF WEIGHT: reaction forces at the supports (expected total FZ about 61.5 N) ===
PRRSOL,F
ALLSEL,ALL
/COM, === maximum displacement ===
NSORT,U,SUM
*GET,UMAX,SORT,0,MAX
/COM, maximum total displacement [m]:
*STATUS,UMAX
NUSORT
! plot of the deformed shape (in the GUI)
/VIEW,1,-1,-1.15,0.6
PLNSOL,U,SUM,1
FINISH
